X:1
T:Kritikos Syrtos
O:Greece (Crete)
N:Greek traditional dance from Crete (Ta Mavra Rouha, Syrto Haniotikos), from the mu-tech.org WorldTrad setting. Melody MIDI diffed note by note; chords read from its lead sheet and accompaniment. The setting opens with a held G bar, left out here. E is natural in the last bar, hence the Dorian signature.
M:4/4
Q:1/4=120
L:1/8
K:Gdor
